    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Quote lines whose effective discount (1 − NetPrice/ListPrice) exceeds 50%.
Why it matters: Heavy discounts often slip past approvals or reflect a misconfigured price rule. Above 50% you&apos;re either giving away margin or have a configuration error you haven&apos;t noticed.
Suppress a finding: when the discount is approved and documented (e.g. strategic enterprise deal).
Disable the detector: only if 50%+ discounts are common in your model. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
